{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "Start Backend",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["-m", "uvicorn", "app.main:app", "--host", "127.0.0.1", "--port", "8000", "--reload"],
      "options": {
        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}/backend",
        "env": {
          "PYTHONPATH": "."
        }
      },
      "problemMatcher": []
    }
  ]
} 

To run this task from the "Run Task" menu, follow these steps:
1. Open the Command Palette (Ctrl + Shift + P or Cmd + Shift + P on Mac).
2. Type "Run Task" and select it from the dropdown.
3. Choose "Start Backend" from the list of available tasks.

This will execute the task without needing to type the command in the terminal again.